[I] A Qt6 module for keyframe-based timeline construction

[T] Qt Quick Timeline is a Qt 6 module for keyframe-based timeline
[T] construction, allowing animations in Qt Quick to be defined by keyframes
[T] on a timeline rather than by bindings.

